== Appearance==
Lingyang is a pale leonine boy with a small statured but athletic build and periwinkle colored eyes. He has long white hair that fades into a light cream color and is kept tied into a fluffy ponytail. Lingyang has various lionesque features such as large cat-like ears, sharp teeth, slitted pupils, and a tail. His ears and tail are the same color as his hair with dark brown, almost black, ends on his ears and a dark brown tuft on the end of his tail.

His tacet mark is located on the inner side of his right bicep.

===Clothing===
Lingyang wears a dragon dancers outfit colored in various whites, beiges, browns, blacks, and reds styled with many colorful tassels and bells.

